course: dictionary
lesson: 5478
title: Lassie: a girl or a famous dog
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A lassie is a girl or young woman. You will hear it in Scotland and Northern England, in everyday talk like «a wee lassie», meaning a little girl. Context helps you here: the sentence is about a girl, and it is said with warmth.
explain: Lassie can also be a name for a famous brave collie dog from books, films and TV. Look at the clues. If the story is about a dog who rescues people, then Lassie is the dog's name. A capital L is a clue too.
explain: Ruby is crying at bedtime, and her mum from Glasgow says, «Wee lassie, it's no' the end o' the world.» Her mum is speaking to Ruby, a girl, and her words are comforting. Swap in "girl" and check: "Wee girl, it's no' the end o' the world" still makes sense.
fact: «Lassie» means a girl or young woman, mostly used in Scotland and Northern England.
fact: A lassie is a noun. The plural is «lassies», meaning more than one girl.
fact: With a capital letter, «Lassie» can be the name of a famous brave collie dog.
fact: Scots say «lassies» for girls, «braw» for great, and «hen» for dear.
fact: Related words include lass, laddie and lad.
exercise: «Wee lassie, it's no' the end o' the world.» What does lassie mean here? | A famous collie dog | A small bird | *A girl | A grown-up man
exercise: In a film, a brave collie rescues people from a flood. Which word names the dog? | braw | hen | *Lassie | lassies
exercise: Which word is the plural of lassie, meaning more than one girl? | lassie | *lassies | lass's | laddie
test: Scots say «braw» for what? | Wet | *Great | Girl | Dear
test: A word you do not know is in a sentence about a girl at bedtime. What is the best first step? | Skip the whole sentence for ever | Look only at the first letter | *Read the words around it and check the clues | Guess it means dog
exam: Which statement about lassie is true? | It is only a boy's name | *It is a Scottish word for a girl, and also the name of a famous dog | It means a loud noise | It is a type of petrol station
